## Decision Status Definitions

**Proposed:** Decision proposed but not yet finalized
**Accepted:** Decision accepted and being implemented
**Deprecated:** Decision superseded by a later decision
**Superseded:** Replaced by ADR-XXX (link to replacing decision)

